  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- New headless verb `developer-workspace \"<host root>\"`: writes the host-development specs (HostCustomization.md, _FieldCommon.md, ScriptExtensions.md) to `<host root>/ClaudeCodeForDeveloper/_specs/` for Claude Code sessions that edit the C# host solution. Works without a design project and only owns the `_`-prefixed entries of that folder (static documents shipped by the host, e.g. Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Starter's setup procedure, live next to them).\n- Claude Code workspace: the default design project folder name is now `design` (was `Design`); the workspace is one design project's working folder (Project.md / ddl / docs / design), which also creates `docs/`. Rules updated: confirm the base before building a business app on a sample/showcase/business-template project (propose a new Empty / EmptyAuth project instead), confirm core business requirements (approval route, roles, tax/rounding, numbering) before defaulting them, lead completion reports with what the user receives, and describe the `DesignProjects/<name>/` layout used when living next to a host solution.\n- Reference updated to Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Designer 1.3.25.",
